    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d672">

                <pb facs="0800" n="708" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg708"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/10781</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Haitian Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Ménos</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 15, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    announce officially to Your Excellency that the Council of State of the Republic
                    of Haiti, exercising the legislative power by virtue of the Constitution in
                    force, has declared, on the report of the Executive branch, that a state of war
                    exists between the Republic of Haiti and the Empire of Germany as from July 12
                    instant.</p>
                <p>This decision, called forth by the aggressive and offensive attitude of the
                    Imperial German Government toward the Haitian Nation, <pb facs="0801" n="709"
                        xml:id="pg709"/> implies at the same time a full indorsement by my
                    Government of the noble views which the President of the United States
                    expressed, notably in his memorable address of July 4.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d672-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>I take pleasure [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Solon Ménos</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
